# Whitelist approach: ignore everything except the PWA app files.
# Personal health data (health_data.json, Daily_Health_Tracking.xlsx,
# training plans, backups) must never be pushed to this public repo.
*
!.gitignore
!index.html
!health-pwa.html
!manifest.json
!service-worker.js
!PWA-SETUP.md
!GITHUB-PAGES-SETUP.md
!GIT-WORKFLOW.md
